OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor's #30m pledge for train
OL,4,Astation is insult to the people of
OL,5,AWales, minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA #30m rail funding pledge announced by
OL,8,FChancellor John Healey in the Budget is
OL,9,F"an insult to the people of Wales", a
OL,10,FWelsh government minister says.
OL,12,FWales' Transport Minister Mark Hooper
OL,13,Fsaid the investment in the proposed
OL,14,FCardiff Parkway station was "a tiny
OL,15,Ffraction" of the cash needed to improve
OL,16,FWelsh rail.
OL,18,FThe Plaid Cymru-led Welsh government
OL,19,Fhad called on Healey to bring forward
OL,20,F#1bn of the #14bn the UK Labour
OL,21,Fgovernment had promised for long-term
OL,22,Frail funding in Wales.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
